{"name":"Breakfast Blend","hex":"#6d5542","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"breakfast","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The first meal of the day, usually eaten in the morning.","A meal consisting of food normally eaten in the morning, which may typically include eggs, sausages, toast, bacon, etc."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To eat the morning meal.","To serve breakfast to."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/breakfast"},{"term":"blend","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A mixture of two or more things.","A word formed by combining two other words; a portmanteau word."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To mingle; to mix; to unite intimately; to pass or shade insensibly into each other.","To be mingled or mixed."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blend"}],"entries":[{"title":"Breakfast","blocks":[{"text":"Breakfast is the first meal of the day, usually eaten in the morning. The word in English refers to breaking the fasting period of the previous night. Various \"typical\" or \"traditional\" breakfast menus exist, with food choices varying by regions and traditions worldwide."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Breakfast_at_the_Black_Bear_Diner.jpg/330px-Breakfast_at_the_Black_Bear_Diner.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Breakfast"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg/500px-Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg/1280px-Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.jpg/500px-Floris_Claesz._van_Dyck_001.j